  "details": "I open Vrchat on my Meta Quest 3s, (not even a year old too!), I enter my home world and notice lagging and shaking, after 5-10 seconds it stops. I clear my content cache and my texture cache to prevent lag and to prevent crashing, (note this started happening since the past few recent updates) then when I go into a public server/instance such as Audience Anarchy or Blackout, if I’m in there for 25-30 minutes I crash, even with avatars off, and if I’m lucky I can last in a friends + instance for at least 1 hour and 20 minutes estimate. It has not just happened to me as a quest player but multiple people I talk to who are Pc, PcVr, etc are experiencing issues the same as me. Is there anything Vrchat can do to fix this??",
